<title>UK: Eurotherm tumbles after results.</title>
<headline>Eurotherm tumbles after results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Eurotherm Plc were marked down 10p to 550p in pre-market trading after the British electronic equipment maker disappointed the market with its annual profits, dealers said.  </p>
<p>Eurotherm said its annual pre-tax profits rose to 37.7 million stg, up from 34.1 million stg in the previous year, but at the low end of analysts' forecasts.</p>
<p>Dealers said earnings estimates ranged between 38 million and 40 million stg.</p>
<p>--Debra Sherman, London newsroom +44 171 542 4026</p>
